<body>
    <h1>Transform Validate And Migration Approach(INT to PROD)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"TransformValidateAndMigrationApproach(INTtoPROD)-MigrationStrateg=
y"><strong><span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Migration</span> <sp=
an class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Strategy</span></strong></h2>
<p><span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">The</span> <span class=3D"__=
_1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">proposed</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gp=
dv f5p0z4x">migration</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">ap=
proach</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">treats</span> <sp=
an class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5b=
dp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">existing</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p=
0z4x">INT</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">environment</s=
pan> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">as</span> <span class=3D"_=
__1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f=
5p0z4x">primary</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">migratio=
n</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">and</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">validation</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bd=
p f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">environment.</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv =
f5p0z4x">Rather</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">than</sp=
an> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">using</span> <code><span cl=
ass=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">targets.json</span></code> as the sourc=
e of migration data, the migration will leverage the existing curated opera=
tional data stored within the legacy INT data structures. This data already=
 contains the <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">business</span> <=
span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">information</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">required</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp =
f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">to</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">con=
struct</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoint</span> <=
span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Catalogue</span> <span class=3D"=
___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">resources,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1=
w7gpdv f5p0z4x">including</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x=
">Service</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Identifiers,</=
span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Provider</span> <span cla=
ss=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Organisations,</span> <span class=3D"___=
1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoint</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpd=
v f5p0z4x">relationships,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x=
">Product</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Identifiers,</=
span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">and</span> <span class=3D=
"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">routing</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7=
gpdv f5p0z4x">information.</span></p>
<p>The objective of the migration is to transform the legacy data model int=
o the new Endpoint Catalogue FHIR R4 compliant structure and validate the r=
esulting resources before any data is promoted to the PROD environment. By =
performing all transformation and validation activities within INT, the mig=
ration process reduces production risk and ensures only high-quality, valid=
ated data is deployed. <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">This</sp=
an> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">approach</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">separates</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp=
 f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">data</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">=
transformation</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">from</spa=
n> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">production</span> <span clas=
s=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">deployment,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5=
bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">allowing</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5=
p0z4x">defects,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">data</sp=
an> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">quality</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">issues,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f=
1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">and</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">map=
ping</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">discrepancies</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">to</span> <span class=3D"___1=
cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">be</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z=
4x">identified</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">and</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">resolved</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">before</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1=
w7gpdv f5p0z4x">a</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">produc=
tion</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">release</span> <spa=
n class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">is</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp=
 f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">considered.</span></p>
<p>Once the transformed resources <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4=
x">have</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">successfully</sp=
an> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">passed</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">all</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7g=
pdv f5p0z4x">validation</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">=
checks,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span=
 class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">validated</span> <span class=3D"___1=
cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">dataset</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv =
f5p0z4x">becomes</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</sp=
an> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">approved</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">migration</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp=
 f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">artefact.</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0=
z4x">That</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">approved</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">dataset</span> <span class=3D=
"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">is</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv =
f5p0z4x">then</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">promoted</=
span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">to</span> <span class=3D"=
___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">PROD</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv=
 f5p0z4x">using</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">a</span>=
 <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">controlled</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">deployment</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bd=
p f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">process</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z=
4x">without</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">requiring</s=
pan> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">any</span> <span class=3D"=
___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">further</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7g=
pdv f5p0z4x">data</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">transf=
ormation</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">activities.</sp=
an></p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"TransformValidateAndMigrationApproach(INTtoPROD)-FHIRR4Transforma=
tionProcess"><strong><span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">FHIR</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">R4</span> <span class=3D"___1=
cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Transformation</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1=
w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Process</span></strong></h2>
<p>The migration process begins by <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z=
4x">extracting</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">data</spa=
n> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">from</span> <span class=3D"_=
__1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f=
5p0z4x">legacy</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">INT</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">data</span> <span class=3D"__=
_1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">sources,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gp=
dv f5p0z4x">including</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">He=
althcare</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Services,</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoints,</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoint</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp =
f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Templates,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0=
z4x">and</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Organisations.<=
/span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">These</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">datasets</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp =
f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">are</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">us=
ed</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">to</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">construct</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp=
 f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">e=
quivalent</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">FHIR</span> <s=
pan class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">R4</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5b=
dp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">resources</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5=
p0z4x">required</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">by</span=
> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___=
1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoint</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpd=
v f5p0z4x">Catalogue.</span></p>
<p><span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">During</span> <span class=3D=
"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">transformation,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5=
bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x=
">migration</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">process</spa=
n> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">converts</span> <span class=
=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7g=
pdv f5p0z4x">legacy</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">reco=
rds</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">into</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">three</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp =
f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">key</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">re=
source</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">types:</span></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"442a5d6d-003c-45a9-8935-29cb934914c4"><span class=3D"___1=
cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoint</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv=
 f5p0z4x">Templates</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fab8ed8e-671f-4fdb-8e94-a5d302296a92"><span class=3D"___1=
cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoints</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9826a96a-d457-4357-ae64-63bd4a5fa5ba"><span class=3D"___1=
cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">HealthcareServices</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Each resource is populated using information obtained from the existing =
INT data store and mapped to the FHIR R4 structure expected <span class=3D"=
___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">by</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f=
5p0z4x">the</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Endpoint</sp=
an> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">Catalogue.</span> <span cla=
ss=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">This</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1=
w7gpdv f5p0z4x">includes</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x"=
>generating</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">the</span> <=
span class=3D"___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">necessary</span> <span class=3D"=
___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x">identifiers,</span> <span class=3D"___1cs5bdp =
