<h3 id=3D"TransformValidateAndMigrationApproach(INTtoPROD)-TransformationFa=
ilureReporting">Transformation Failure Reporting</h3>
<p>Any records that cannot be successfully transformed into Endpoint Catalo=
gue FHIR R4 resources due to missing mandatory attributes or invalid source=
 data will be excluded from the transformed dataset and recorded in a trans=
formation failure report.</p>
<p>The transformation failure report will capture:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2eef07e1-0d9c-4bba-acc5-41e58f09262e">Resource Type</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"19ea0a05-46b1-488c-993c-399b6f573ac6">Resource Identifier=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c98e7f1b-1fc9-48dc-bc3a-daeb8110d34b">Failure Reason</li>
</ul>
<p>This report provides traceability for excluded records and supports reme=
diation activities without affecting the approved migration dataset. The re=
port will be retained alongside the transformation manifest above.</p>
<h3 id=3D"TransformValidateAndMigrationApproach(INTtoPROD)-AuditArtefacts">=
Audit Artefacts</h3>
<p>The following artefacts will be generated during transformation:<br>
  transformation-manifest.json<br>
  transformation-failures.json</p>
